  m_text: "But the \u201Csnowman\u201D it feels wrong. It feels closer. Colder. \nEvery
    time I think of it, something tightens in my chest. I don\u2019t know why, but
    I feel the hidden truth is waiting at the dorm. I have to go back there. "
